ing among you, or fool everyone at the table?</p>","developers":["EY GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/e953331633616e3edf7733df2c3d8ad2f4e3adb6/header.jpg?t=1758009713","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184500,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184500/movie480.mp4?t=1756286493","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184500/movie_max.mp4?t=1756286493"},"name":"Mole or Not - Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184500/600e8f596a5ccb785ca3c58def1c17d21f22d2ba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756286493","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184500/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756286493","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184500/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756286493"}}],"name":"Mole or Not","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3-8100 / Ryzen 3 2200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1030 / Radeon RX 550<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GTX1060 / Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</s